{
  "name": "extensions",
  "description": "This repository defines internal Wayland protocol extensions utilized by the Qt framework to handle low-level inter-process communication between compositors and clients. These specifications provide high-performance mechanisms for server-side buffer management, hardware-accelerated texture sharing, and platform-specific graphics abstractions for backends like EGL, Vulkan, and DMABUF. By enforcing a versioned schema, the extensions ensure interoperability across heterogeneous Qt deployments and safeguard against protocol breakages in complex graphics pipelines.",
